{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102440","id":2316292619,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6KD9IL","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102440","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102440/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102440/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102440/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/be81b0685f1e0d588faa9a8d70aca4b81006a718","number":102440,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Prevent instantiating classes that aren't exposed","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Originally from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99534\r\n\r\nCurrently, if you call `ClassDB::can_instantiate(\"...\")` for an internal class, it will return `true`, but most normal ways of instantiating the class in GDScript, GDExtension or C# won't work. However, they still can be created via `ClassDB::instantiate(\"...\")`. There's also no indication to GDExtension or scripting from `ClassDB` that these classes can't be instantiated normally because we don't expose `ClassDB::class_is_exposed()`.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n\r\n```\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\t# Prints: true\r\n\tprint(ClassDB.class_exists(\"AnimationNodeStartState\"))\r\n\r\n\t# Prints: true\r\n\tprint(ClassDB.can_instantiate(\"AnimationNodeStartState\"))\r\n\r\n\t# Prints: <AnimationNodeStartState#12345>\r\n\tprint(ClassDB.instantiate(\"AnimationNodeStartState\"))\r\n\r\n\t# ERROR!\r\n\tAnimationNodeStartState.new()\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Do we even want internal classes to be instantiatable via `ClassDB::instantiate(\"...\")`?**\r\n\r\nThis PR answers **no**, and makes it so that internal classes return `false` for `ClassDB::can_instantiate()` and can't be created via `ClassDB::instantiate(\"...\")`.\r\n\r\nI don't _think_ there's anything that depends on the old behavior, but I'm not 100% sure, so treat this one with caution.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3